---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';

import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import { MEDIA } from '../content/media';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Pierce O’Brien | Pierce O’Brien Piano"
  description="Meet Pierce O’Brien, RPT: a piano technician whose work is grounded in musical listening, recording-industry experience, and thoughtful piano care."
>
  <PageIntro
    title="About Pierce"
    introduction="Pierce O’Brien, RPT, is a guild-certified piano technician whose work begins with music, careful listening, and respect for the instrument in front of him."
    image={MEDIA.hero}
    imageAlt="Pierce O’Brien working at the strings of a grand piano"
    imagePosition="center"
    actionLabel="Book With Pierce"
  />

  <section class="section section--paper">
    <div class="portrait-layout shell">
      <div class="media-frame media-frame--portrait">
        <Image
          src={MEDIA.workingMonochrome}
          alt="Pierce O’Brien working at an open grand piano"
          widths={[640, 960, 1280]}
          sizes="(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 40vw"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>A musician’s ear for the details.</h2>
        <p>
          Before moving to Salt Lake City, Pierce spent more than five years in Nashville’s
          recording industry, in rooms where small changes could reshape what a performance felt
          like.
        </p>
        <p>
          That experience still informs his work at the piano: listen carefully, understand what the
          instrument is capable of, and give the owner clear, useful guidance without making the
          conversation feel technical for its own sake.
        </p>
        <p>
          For a closer look at Pierce’s service philosophy—from assessment through long-term care—
          visit the <a href="/piano-care-approach/">piano care approach</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="owner-event shell">
      <div class="owner-event-copy">
        <h2>Continued study, close to the work.</h2>
        <p>
          This owner-supplied photograph records Pierce at the 2026 Piano Technicians Guild
          convention. Continued study keeps the work grounded in attentive listening, thoughtful
          assessment, and better choices for each individual instrument.
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure class="owner-event-photo">
        <Image
          src={MEDIA.rptEvent}
          alt="Pierce O’Brien beside a Registered Piano Technician convention display"
          widths={[640, 960, 1280]}
          sizes="(max-width: 960px) 86vw, 50vw"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <figcaption>Owner-supplied convention photograph.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--dark statement">
    <div class="shell">
      <p class="statement-copy">
        Expert care for all pianos—from a family’s first upright to a performance grand.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
